SUMMARY: Spring Live Music Series: Mike Ferfolia Trio
DESCRIPTION:Decribed as engaging\, dynamic and versatile\, Mike Ferfolia’
 s Trio has a unique style driven by powerhouse vocals\, virtuosic guitar 
 playing and rhythmic grounding reminiscent of The Police & The Jimi Hendr
 ix Experience. With a combined performance experience of nearly 8 decades
 \, MF3 breathes new life into hits from Tears For Fears\, Stevie Wonder\,
  The Beatles\, Earth Wind & Fire\, and more favourites. You’re not just w
 atching a performance\, you’re engaged in a musical conversation between 
 three seasoned veterans\, guaranteed to be a show like no other.
