DESCRIPTION:Brooke Blackburn is a seasoned guitarist and vocalist with ov
 er 35 years in the music industry. As a member of the Juno-nominated band
  Blackburn\, he has captivated audiences across Canada\, the US\, and Eur
 ope. Brooke's sound blends elements of roots\, jazz\, folk\, and blues\, 
 while his mastery of the Motown catalogue and timeless classics ensures a
 n unforgettable\, feel-good atmosphere for any event.
