SUMMARY: Free Mini Putt: Father's Day Weekend At The Distillery District
DESCRIPTION:Putt your way through a fun-filled family weekend this Father
 's Day! Join us for FREE Mini Putt at The Distillery Historic District! ⛳
 ️\n\nThat's right\, we're rolling out a nine-hole Mini Putt course on Gri
 stmill Lane. FREE - no registration required!\n\n\nEVENT DETAILS! ⤵️\n\n?
 ? Friday June 19th to Sunday June 21st from 12PM-8PM.\n\n👉 Putters & Bal
 ls available at each hole. Pick Up & Putt!\n\n👉 Get started near the hea
 rt sculpture on the west end of Gristmill Lane.\n\n\nHope to see you teei
 ng off this weekend! & Don't forget to tag us @distilleryTO https://x.com
 /distilleryTO
CATEGORIES:
